{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15210310","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1521031001:0":{"text":"도련님, 무슨 일로...","source_cn":"小公子，您怎么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0464710B01D34CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521031002:0":{"text":"카토가 물어보려던 말이 궁금해. 음... 그리고 그 소문도.","source_cn":"我想知道卡托刚刚想问什么。唔……还有你说的那些流言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80924A95CA75963C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521031003:0":{"text":"무슨 말을 해도 화 안 낼게. 어... 다른 사람한테도 말 안 할게.","source_cn":"不管你们说什么，我都不会生气——呃，也不会告诉其他人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16D5937E5F5CD163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521031004:0":{"text":"정말요?","source_cn":"……真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7634858F19B91C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521031005:1":{"text":"카토...","source_cn":"卡托……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8B9463FA02EEDCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521031006:1":{"text":"도련님은 분명히 영주님을 뵌 적